,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lgUHt","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T19:17:27Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T19:17:27Z","body":"Possibly related to #104861, there seem to be a lot of Resource + _init issues","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776711661/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3102526920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104952#issuecomment-3102526920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104952","id":3102526920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc647M3I","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T12:34:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T12:34:30Z","body":"I have figured out the cause of this bug.\n\n* When the GDScript VM is called to init the Theme, this happens before the scene is setup.\n* The GDScript VM polls the debugger `EngineDebugger::get_singleton()->line_poll();`.\n* This causes `SceneDebugger::parse_message` to be called, and trigger an error, because the scene is not yet properly setup.\n\nChanges that prevent this bug:\n\n* Increasing the starting `EngineDebugger::poll_every` to 1 will prevent the `line_poll()` calll from calling `poll_events()` (not a good/permanent solution)\n* Disabling the `line_poll()` call (obviously not a solution, but does prevent the bug)\n\nI think somebody with more engine experience than me would know how to better untaggle this web. Probably moving the \"scene:setup_scene\" message to somewhere else more appropriate?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3102526920/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]